WEBVTT

00:00:00.708 --> 00:00:08.464
With several agents running, Mission control shows all of them at once, across every project, as live tiles.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:11.139
Agents that need you come first.

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:14.281
This one is asking which sort order to use.

00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:18.279
You can answer right from the tile, without opening the session.

00:00:21.736 --> 00:00:26.705
It's back to work. Every tile is a live terminal, so you can follow along.

00:00:32.459 --> 00:00:40.811
Finished sessions move down to Earlier today, with Push, Pull base and Finish one click away.

00:00:40.811 --> 00:00:46.019
Press Option M to switch back to the projects at any time.
